{"id":"627929","name":"槐花馅饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/627929/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"槐花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许(40度以下)"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"看，槐树。","img":"images/627929/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"撸的槐花。","img":"images/627929/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淘洗干净，控水。","img":"images/627929/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"淖一下，捞出，控干水分。","img":"images/627929/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"择好的葱，洗净，切碎，备用。","img":"images/627929/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"槐花和葱放入盆中，热油浇一下，加适量盐调味。","img":"images/627929/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀，备用。","img":"images/627929/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"温水和面,用筷子搅拌成絮状，醒15分钟,揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/627929/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀剂子。","img":"images/627929/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀成圆薄饼。","img":"images/627929/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/627929/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再擀成薄圆饼。","img":"images/627929/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"平底锅烧热,放入饼胚。","img":"images/627929/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"小火慢烙。","img":"images/627929/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻面,烙至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/627929/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/627929/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"对半切开，方便食用。","img":"images/627929/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"清香扑鼻，醉了。","img":"images/627929/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}